<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Jacques</para>
  <para style="toc1">JACQUES</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jacques</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jc</para>
  <para style="mt1">JACQUES</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 12:17">Trav 12:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jacques, yon sèvitè-atache nèt a Bondye, ak Senyè a, Jésus Kris, a douz tribi ki gaye a letranje yo, salitasyon.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:12">Mat 5:12</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:6">I Pi 1:6</ref></char>
    </note>Konsidere sa kòm tout lajwa, frè m yo, lè nou rankontre tout kalite eprèv yo <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />nan konnen ke eprèv lafwa nou pwodwi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:19">Luc 21:19</ref></char></note>andirans. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Konsa, kite andirans lan fè rezilta pafè li, pou nou kab vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:48">Mat 5:48</ref></char></note>pafè e konplè, san manke anyen.<verse eid="JAS 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Men si nenpòt nan nou manke sajès,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:9">I Wa 3:9</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7">Mat 7:7</ref></char></note> kite li mande Bondye, ki bay tout moun avèk jenewozite e san repwòch, e Bondye va bay li. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Men li dwe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:21">Mat 21:21</ref></char></note>mande nan lafwa, san doute, paske sila ki doute a tankou vag lanmè, ki pouse e voye pa van an. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Paske moun sa a pa dwe sipoze ke li va resevwa anyen nan men Senyè a, <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />tankou yon moun ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 4:8">Jc 4:8</ref></char></note>doub panse, ki enstab nan tout chemen li yo.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luc 14:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Kite frè ki nan sikonstans ki ba, bay glwa nan wo pozisyon li; <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />e kite moun rich la, bay glwa nan imilyasyon li, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:31">I Kor 7:31</ref></char></note>tankou zèb k ap fleri, li osi va disparèt. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Paske solèy la leve avèk yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:12">Mat 20:12</ref></char></note>gwo chalè, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:7">És 40:7</ref></char></note>zèb la seche; flè li tonbe, e bote aparans li an vin disparèt. Konsa tou, moun rich la nan mitan tout sa l ap chèche yo, li va vin disparèt.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 6:22">Luc 6:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Beni se yon moun ki pèsevere anba eprèv. Paske, yon fwa li fin apwouve, li va resevwa kouwòn lavi a ke Senyè a pwomèt a sila ki renmen Li yo. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Pa kite pèsòn di lè l tante: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:1">Jen 22:1</ref></char></note>“Se Bondye k ap tante m,” paske Bondye pa kapab tante pa mal, e Li menm, Li pa tante pèsòn. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Men chak moun tante lè li pote ale pa pwòp move dezi li yo. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Alò, lè move dezi a fin jèmen, li bay nesans a peche. Epi lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:12">Wo 5:12</ref></char></note>peche a fin akonpli, li pote lanmò.<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 6:9">I Kor 6:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pinga nou vin twonpe, frè byeneme mwen yo.<verse eid="JAS 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Tout bon bagay ki fèt ak tout kado pafè sòti anwo, epi desann nan Papa a limyè yo. Avèk Li pa gen ni chanjman ni menm yon lonbraj varyasyon. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Nan egzèsis volonte Li, Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:3">I Pi 1:3</ref>,<ref loc="1PE 1:23">23</ref></char></note>fè nou vin parèt pa pawòl verite a pou nou ta kapab vin tankou<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:4">Rev 14:4</ref></char></note>premye fwi pami kreyati Li yo.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Nou konnen sa, frè byeneme m yo. Men tout moun dwe gen vitès nan tande, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:19">Pwov 10:19</ref></char></note>lan nan pale, e lan nan fè kòlè. <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:22">Mat 5:22</ref></char></note>kòlè a lòm pa pwodwi ladwati Bondye.<verse eid="JAS 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Konsa, annou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:22">Ef 4:22</ref></char></note>mete sou kote tout sa ki sal, ak tout sa ki rete de mechanste, e ak imilite, resevwa pawòl ki enplante nan nou an, ki kapab sove nanm nou.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7:24-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Men, fè prèv tèt nou ke nou aji selon pawòl la, e se pa senpleman tande li. Moun konsa yo twonpe pwòp tèt yo. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Paske si yon moun ap tande pawòl la, e li pa aji selon li, li tankou yon moun ki gade figi natirèl li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 13:12">I Kor 13:12</ref></char></note>nan yon miwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />Yon fwa, li fin gade tèt li e li ale, li gen tan bliye ki kalite moun li te ye a.<verse eid="JAS 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Men yon moun ki gade avèk atansyon lalwa pafè a, lalwa libète a, e aji selon li, li pa vin yon moun ki tande pou bliye, men yon moun ki fè l tout bon, moun sa a va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:17">Jn 13:17</ref></char></note>beni nan sa li fè.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Si yon moun panse nan tèt li ke li swiv Bondye tout tan, e malgre sa, li pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 39:1">Sòm 39:1</ref></char></note>mete yon brid sou lang li, li pase pwòp tèt li nan betiz, e lafwa moun sa a vin san valè.<verse eid="JAS 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Relijyon ki pafè e san tach devan zye a Bondye, Papa nou a se sa a: vizite òfelen e vèv ki nan nesesite yo, e kenbe tèt nou san tach <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:4">II Pi 1:4</ref></char></note>de mond lan.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Frè m yo, pa kenbe lafwa nou nan Senyè laglwa nou an, Jésus Kri avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:34">Trav 10:34</ref></char></note>patipri.<verse eid="JAS 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Paske si yon moun vini nan asanble nou an avèk yon bag ki fèt an lò, abiye ak bèl rad, e la tou, gen yon pòv ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 3:3">Za 3:3</ref></char></note>rad sal, <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />epi nou prete atansyon espesyal a sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:11">Luc 23:11</ref></char></note>byen abiye a, e nou di l: “Ou mèt chita la nan yon bon plas”, epi nou di a pòv la: “Chita laba”, oubyen: “Chita bò pye m nan”, <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />Èske nou pa fè yon distenksyon pami nou menm, e nou vin jij <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 18:6">Luc 18:6</ref></char></note>avèk move lentansyon?<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Koute, frè byeneme m yo, èske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 34:19">Job 34:19</ref></char></note>Bondye pa t chwazi pòv a mond sa a pou vin rich nan lafwa, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:3">Mat 5:3</ref></char></note>eritye a wayòm ke Li te pwomèt a sila ki renmen Li yo? <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Men nou te dezonore moun pòv la. Èske se pa rich yo ki oprime nou e mennen nou tout nan tribinal. <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:26">Trav 11:26</ref></char></note>Èske yo pa blasfeme bèl non pa sila nou te resevwa apèl la?<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Men, si nou ap akonpli lalwa wayal la selon Lekriti a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref></char></note>“Nou dwe renmen vwazen nou, tankou tèt nou,” nou ap fè byen.<verse eid="JAS 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Men si nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:34">Trav 10:34</ref></char></note>montre patipri, nou ap fè peche e gen tan vin koupab devan lalwa kòm transgresè. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Paske sila ki kenbe tout lalwa a, malgre sa, li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 3:2">Jc 3:2</ref></char></note>tonbe nan yon sèl, li vin koupab de tout. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Paske, Sila a ki te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Egz 20:14</ref></char></note>“Pa fè adiltè” a, Li te di tou: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 5:17">Det 5:17</ref></char></note>“Pa touye moun”. Alò, si nou pa fè adiltè, men nou touye moun, nou gen tan vin yon transgresè lalwa. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Konsa, pale e aji kòm sila ki va jije pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:25">Jc 1:25</ref></char></note>lalwa libète a. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 21:13">Pwov 21:13</ref></char></note>jijman va san mizerikòd pou sila ki pa montre mizerikòd la, paske mizerikòd triyonfe sou jijman.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 1:22">Jc 1:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kisa sa sèvi, frè m yo, si yon moun di ke li gen lafwa, men li pa gen zèv? Èske lafwa sa a kapab sove li? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:35">Mat 25:35</ref></char></note>Si yon frè oubyen yon sè san rad, e nan bezwen manje chak jou, <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />epi youn nan nou di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:17">I Jn 3:17</ref></char></note>“Ale anpè; chofe kò nou e plen vant nou,” men malgre sa, nou pa bay yo sa ke yo bezwen pou kò yo, kisa sa sèvi? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Menm jan an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:6">Gal 5:6</ref></char></note>lafwa, si li pa gen zèv, li mouri pou kont li.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Konsa, yon moun ka byen di: “Ou gen lafwa e mwen gen zèv. Montre m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:28">Wo 3:28</ref></char></note>lafwa ou a san zèv, e mwen va montre ou lafwa pa m nan pa zèv.”<verse eid="JAS 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Ou kwè ke Bondye se yon sèl. Ou fè byen. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:29">Mat 8:29</ref></char></note>Demon yo kwè tou, e yo tranble. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Men èske ou dakò pou rekonèt, o moun ensanse, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:6">Gal 5:6</ref></char></note>lafwa san zèv vin initil? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:9">Jen 22:9</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 22:10">10</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 22:12">12</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 22:16-18">16-18</ref></char></note>Èske Abraham, zansèt nou an, pa t jistifye pa zèv lè li te ofri Isaac, fis li a, sou lotèl la? <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Nou wè ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:17">Eb 11:17</ref></char></note>lafwa t ap travay avèk zèv li yo, e kòm rezilta a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 1:3">I Tes 1:3</ref></char></note>zèv lafwa li a te vin pafè. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Konsa, Lekriti a te akonpli sa ki di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Jen 15:6</ref></char></note>“Abraham te kwè Bondye, e sa te konte pou li kòm ladwati,” e li te rele zanmi a Bondye a. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Menmjan nou wè ke yon nonm jistifye pa zèv, e non sèlman pa lafwa a. <verse eid="JAS 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Paske menm jan èske Rahab, fanm movèz vi a, p at jistifye pa zèv lè l te resevwa mesajè yo epi te voye yo ale pa yon lòt chemen an? <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Paske menm jan ke kò san lespri a mouri deja, menm jan an tou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:6">Gal 5:6</ref></char></note>lafwa san zèv deja mouri.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 2:20">Wo 2:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pa kite anpil nan nou ansenye, frè m yo, paske nou konnen ke konsa, nou va resevwa yon jijman ki pi sevè.<verse eid="JAS 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Paske nou tout tonbe nan plizyè sans. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34-37">Mat 12:34-37</ref></char></note>Si yon moun pa tonbe nan sa li di, li menm se yon moun pafè, li kapab kontwole tout kò a menm jan an.<verse eid="JAS 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Koulye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 32:9">Sòm 32:9</ref></char></note>si nou mete mò nan bouch a cheval yo pou yo kab obeyi nou, nou dirije tout kò yo tou.<verse eid="JAS 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Gade menm bato yo; malgre yo trè gran e pouse pa gwo van, yo toujou dirije pa yon gouvènè tou piti nenpòt kote volonte a pilòt la pito. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Menm jan an tou, lang lan se yon pati tou piti nan kò a, e malgre sa, li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 12:3">Sòm 12:3</ref></char></note>vante gwo bagay.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 3:5">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 26:20">Pwov 26:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gade kijan yon gwo forè vin pran dife pa yon flanm ki tou piti! <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 120:2">Sòm 120:2</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 120:3">3</ref></char></note>lang lan se yon dife, yon vrè mond linikite a. Lang lan plase pami manm kò nou yo, kòm sila ki konwonpi tout kò a nèt. Li mete dife nan kous lavi nou menm, e li limen pa lanfè a.<verse eid="JAS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Paske tout kalite bèt ak zwazo, reptil ak kreyati lanmè yo, donte e vin donte pa ras lòm nan. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Men pèsòn pa kapab donte lang lan. Li se yon mechanste ki endontab e plen ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 140:3">Sòm 140:3</ref></char></note>pwazon mòtèl.<verse eid="JAS 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Avèk li, nou beni Senyè nou an ak Papa a, e avèk li, nou madichonnen moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Jen 1:26</ref></char></note>ki fèt ak limaj Bondye. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Nan menm bouch la, sòti ni benediksyon ni madichon. Frè m yo, bagay sa yo pa dwe konsa.<verse eid="JAS 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Èske yon sous kapab koule dlo fre avèk dlo anmè nan menm bouch la? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:16">Mat 7:16</ref></char></note>Èske yon pye fig frans, frè m yo, pwodwi oliv, oubyen yon pye rezen pwodwi fig? Ni dlo sale pa kapab pwodwi dlo fre.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Kilès pami nou ki saj e ki gen bon konprann? Ke li montre sa pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:12">I Pi 2:12</ref></char></note>bon kondwit li, zèv li nan dousè a sajès la.<verse eid="JAS 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Men si nou gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:8">Wo 2:8</ref></char></note>jalouzi, fachez ak anbisyon pèsonèl nan kè nou, pa vin awogan, epi bay manti kont verite a. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Kalite sajès sa a pa sòti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:17">Jc 1:17</ref></char></note>anwo a, men nan mond lan. Li chanèl e dyabolik. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Paske kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:8">Wo 2:8</ref></char></note>jalouzi ak anbisyon pèsonèl egziste, gen dezòd ak tout kalite move bagay.<verse eid="JAS 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Men sajès ki sòti anwo a, dabò, li pafè, answit, li pezib, dous, rezonab, plen ak mizerikòd ak bon fwi, fèm e san <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:9">Wo 12:9</ref></char></note>ipokrizi. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:18">Pwov 11:18</ref></char></note>grenn ki bay fwi ladwati a simen nan lapè pa sila ki fè lapè yo.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Kisa ki sous kont ak konfli <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 3:9">Tit 3:9</ref></char></note>pami nou yo? Èske se pa plezi nou yo k ap fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:23">Wo 7:23</ref></char></note>lagè nan manm kò nou yo? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Nou anvi e nou pa genyen, donk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:6">Jc 5:6</ref></char></note>nou touye moun. Nou anvi e nou pa kab twouve, donk nou goumen e fè kont ak lòt yo. Nou pa genyen paske nou pa mande. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Nou mande e nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:22">I Jn 3:22</ref></char></note>pa resevwa, paske nou mande avèk anbisyon ki pa pwòp yo, pou nou kab pase li nan plezi nou yo.<verse eid="JAS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Nou menm, moun adiltè yo, èske nou pa konprann ke amitye avèk mond lan se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:7">Wo 8:7</ref></char></note>rayisman anvè Bondye? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:24">Mat 6:24</ref></char></note>Konsa, nenpòt moun ki vle zanmi ak mond lan fè tèt li lènmi ak Bondye.<verse eid="JAS 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Oubyen, èske nou panse ke Lekriti sen an pale san rezon: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:19">I Kor 6:19</ref></char></note> “Li jalou pou Lespri a ke Li te fè rete nan nou an?”<verse eid="JAS 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Men Li bay yon pi gwo gras. Konsa, li di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Pwov 3:34</ref></char></note>“Bondye opoze a ògeye yo, men Li fè gras a moun ki enb yo.”<verse eid="JAS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 5:6">I Pi 5:6</ref></char></note>soumèt nou a Bondye. Reziste a dyab la e li va sove ale de nou. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Vin pre Bondye e Li va vin pre nou. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 17:9">Job 17:9</ref></char></note>Netwaye men nou, nou menm pechè; e pirifye kè nou, nou menm, moun ak doub panse. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 14:13">Pwov 14:13</ref></char></note>Se pou nou vin mizerab; lamante e kriye. Kite ri nou yo vin tounen lamantasyon, e lajwa nou yo vin tounen tristès. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:11">Job 5:11</ref></char></note>Desann nou nan prezans Bondye a, e Li menm, Li va fè nou leve.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Pa pale kont youn lòt, frè m yo. Sila ki pale kont yon frè oubyen jije frè li a, pale kont lalwa e jije lalwa. Men si nou jije lalwa, olye nou akonpli lalwa a, nou jije li. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 33:22">És 33:22</ref></char></note>yon sèl ki bay Lalwa; se sèl Li ki kapab sove e detwi. Men nou menm, ki moun nou ye pou jije vwazen nou an?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Vini koulye a, nou menm, ki di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 27:1">Pwov 27:1</ref></char></note>“Jodi a oswa demen, nou va ale nan tèl vil, e pase yon ane la, angaje nou nan biznis pou fè pwofi.” <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Malgre, nou pa konnen kijan lavi nou va ye demen. Paske ki sa lavi ou ye? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:7">Job 7:7</ref></char></note>Li se sèlman yon vapè ki parèt pou yon ti moman, e answit, vin disparèt. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Olye de sa, nou ta dwe di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:21">Trav 18:21</ref></char></note>“Si Bondye vle, nou va viv, e nou va osi fè sesi oubyen sela.”<verse eid="JAS 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Menmjan sa ye a, nou ògeye nan awogans nou. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:6">I Kor 5:6</ref></char></note>Tout ògèy konsa, se mechanste. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:47">Luc 12:47</ref></char></note>a sila ki konnen bon bagay pou li fè a, men pa fè l, a li menm, se peche.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Vini koulye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:24">Luc 6:24</ref></char></note>nou menm ki rich, kriye e rele fò akoz mizè k ap vini sou nou yo. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 50:9">És 50:9</ref></char></note>Richès nou yo gen tan pouri e rad nou yo gen tan manje pa mit. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Lò ak lajan nou yo gen tan pran lawouj, e lawouj yo va yon temwen kont nou, e va manje chè nou tankou dife. Se pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:7">Jc 5:7</ref>,<ref loc="JAS 5:8">8</ref></char></note>dènye jou yo ke nou te mete trezò nou nan depo a! <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Veye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:13">Lev 19:13</ref></char></note>salè a ouvriye ki te rekòlte chan nou yo ke nou te refize vèse bay, vin kriye kont nou; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:23">Egz 2:23</ref></char></note>kri a ouvriye mwason sa yo gen tan rive nan zòrèy a Senyè Sabaot la.<verse eid="JAS 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Nou te viv nan richès sou tè a e mennen yon vi nan gran plezi. Nou te angrese kè nou nan yon jou labatwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Nou te kondane e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 4:2">Jc 4:2</ref></char></note>mete a lanmò nonm jis la; li pa t reziste kont nou.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Konsa, frè m yo, se pou nou pasyan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:22">Jn 21:22</ref></char></note>jiskaske Senyè a vini. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 6:9">Gal 6:9</ref></char></note>Kiltivatè a ap tann pou pwodwi chè a sòti nan tè a. Li pasyan de sa, jiskaske li jwenn premye ak dènye lapli yo. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:19">Luc 21:19</ref></char></note>Nou menm tou, se pou nou pasyan. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 3:13">I Tes 3:13</ref></char></note>Ranfòse kè nou, paske vini a Senyè a touprè.<verse eid="JAS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Pa plenyen, frè m yo, youn kont lòt, pou nou menm tou kapab pa vin jije. Gade <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:5">Kol 4:5</ref></char></note>Jij la kanpe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:33">Mat 24:33</ref></char></note>jis devan pòt la.<verse eid="JAS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Frè m yo, pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:12">Mat 5:12</ref></char></note>pwofèt yo ki pale nan non Senyè a kòm egzanp de soufrans ak pasyans. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Nou konte sa ki te andire yo kòm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:10">Mat 5:10</ref></char></note>beni. Nou te konn tande de sa Job te andire a, e nou te wè jan sa te sòti e jan Senyè a te aji. Konsa nou konnen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:6">Egz 34:6</ref></char></note>Senyè a plen konpasyon ak mizerikòd.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Men, anplis de tout bagay, frè m yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:34-37">Mat 5:34-37</ref></char></note>pa sèmante ni pa syèl la, ni pa tè a, ni pa okenn lòt sèman. Men ke wi ou rete wi e non ou rete non, pou nou pa tonbe anba jijman.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Èske gen moun pami nou k ap soufri? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 50:15">Sòm 50:15</ref></char></note>Fòk li priye. Èske gen moun ak kè kontan? Fòk li chante louwanj. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Èske gen moun pami nou ki malad? Alò, fòk li rele ansyen legliz yo. Kite yo priye sou li, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:13">Mc 6:13</ref></char></note>onksyone li ak lwil nan non Senyè a. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:6">Jc 1:6</ref></char></note>priyè la ki ofri nan lafwa a va restore sila ki malad, e Senyè a va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:39">Jn 6:39</ref></char></note>fè l leve. Si li te fè peche, yo va padone. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:6">Mat 3:6</ref></char></note>konfese peche nou yo a youn lòt e priye pou youn lòt, pou nou kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:13">Eb 12:13</ref></char></note>geri.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 5:16">Lapriyè efikas a yon nonm ki jis kapab akonpli anpil bagay. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Élie se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:15">Trav 14:15</ref></char></note>yon nonm avèk yon nati tankou pa nou an, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">I Wa 17:1</ref></char></note>li te priye fò pou li pa t fè lapli, e li pa t fè lapli sou tè a pandan twazan si mwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Answit, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:42">I Wa 18:42</ref></char></note>priye ankò, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:45">I Wa 18:45</ref></char></note>syèl la te vide lapli, e tè a te pwodwi fwi li.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Frè m yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:15">Mat 18:15</ref></char></note>si yon moun pami nou vin egare e kite verite a, men yon lòt fè l retounen, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />fè li konnen ke sila ki detounen yon pechè soti de erè chemen li an, va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:14">Wo 11:14</ref></char></note>sove nanm li de lanmò, e va kouvri yon gran kantite peche.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>